d amount_due_cents. Preserve the input line order in the response. Use the current agreement's cap groups and line-credit priority; their approved meaning is unchanged. Overall amounts equal total for the same input.\n\nEmpty input returns release \"2.0\", lines [], and both totals zero. One-line example response: {\"release\": \"2.0\", \"credit_cents\": 2999, \"amount_due_cents\": 17000, \"lines\": [{\"line_id\": \"L-1\", \"credit_cents\": 2999, \"amount_due_cents\": 17000}]}. Existing quote and total release support is unchanged.",
